      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Cobalt blue and geometric shapes can indeed have a significant psychological impact. Cobalt blue often conveys a sense of sophistication, confidence, and stability, which luxury brands like [Luxury Brand Name] typically aim to evoke. The repetitive use of this color could create an association with consistency and reliability. Geometric shapes, especially if they are the dominant patterns, add a modern, often bold touch, conveying precision and order. Together, these elements can projected an aura of luxury and high-tech appeal. The aggressive feeling you described might be due to the intensity and dominance of these elements, making them appear modern and imposing rather than simply elegant. Intricate and persistent use of these elements could be a tactic to leave a lasting impression on the consumer.",
